            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nāvis parva in pelagō sōla est. The small ship is alone on the high sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension but neuter: pelagus, pelagī n. A poetic and Greek word. English pelagic 'of the open sea' is related."
